#, javascript-format
msgid ""
"Only tmux sessions named ${ prefix }-… are listed, and the worktrees named $"
"{ prefix }-… of the repositories in ${ watchedDirectories } that have no "
"session, as after a restart. A session opens its page, with the agent's chat "
"and the Open, Review, Trace and Git menus."
msgstr ""
